<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NOBLE AFFILIATES LOWERED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NOBLE AFFILIATES LOWERED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Thomas Driscoll downgraded Noble Affiliates Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said in report move reflected the analyst's concerns about slowing production growth, especially relative to 1998 production forecasts.</p>
<p>-- cut 1998 earnings per share to $8.55 from $8.90.</p>
<p>-- has 12-month price target of $44 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 11/16 to 43-5/8.</p>
</text>
